{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48299","headline":"又留别同院 · 张保胤","name":"又留别同院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔当年富贵时，如今头脑尚依稀。\n布袍破後思宫内，锦袴穿时忆御衣。\n鹘子背钻高力士，婵娟飜画太真妃。\n如今顦顇离南海，恰似当时幸蜀时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张保胤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}